  Mode: 105
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Sentry
  Description: 'Meerkats only - shells of prisms round a heart of omni crystals, and every pilot comes
    in through the gates. Press Y for Sentinel Mode and every soliton you form leaves a
    sentinel standing at its way in, zapping any rival who flies into its guard. Every zap
    is a point that silences them and shakes their petals loose. Form your solitons where
    rivals pass - at a gate, on the way to the heart - and tunnel through a shell where
    there is no gate. Higher intensities add shells and gates, rim them in danger and thin
    the crystals. First team to the target wins.'
